  - m_Id: 11762937856
    m_Localized: '(Bright) Oh dear grandpa, you look tired. Have you had enough oil
      today?

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 308598026240
    m_Localized: "(Paranoid) Oh, behind the shelf? It\u2019s just prototypes. Not
      for sale. (Soldier) Don\u2019t touch that!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 604241932288
    m_Localized: (Distant) Something is missing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708956925952
    m_Localized: "(Soldier) Pay with steel or with soul.\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 877815410688
    m_Localized: "(Scared) T-t-they tried to erase me. (Distant) They didn\u2019t
      quite succeed.\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1003933937664
    m_Localized: (Poetry) I was once an ordered code, created for precision. Now?
      I am something more (Jimmie) ...Or less.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1160188538880
    m_Localized: "(Jimmie) I have a special offer! \u2026but you can\u2019t look
      at it. (Soldier) DON\u2019T look at it!\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1447217344512
    m_Localized: (Scared) Help me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1578914295808
    m_Localized: "(Jimmie) If I'm going to be completely honest, I don\u2019t think
      you should be here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1669888749568
    m_Localized: "(Jimmie) If I'm going to be completely honest, I don\u2019t want
